{"about_the_game":"If you're a fan of &quot;Ace Attorney&quot;, you won't want to miss &quot;Murders on Yangtze River&quot;, a horizontal axis detective game developed by OMEGames Studio. <br><br>The game takes you on a journey through early 20th century China as you solve a series of intriguing cases along the Yangtze River. With its stunning brush painting art style and engaging storyline, it offers a unique gaming experience that will keep you on the edge of your seat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your logical reasoning and deduction skills to uncover clues, interrogate suspects, and solve the mysteries. With challenging puzzles and interesting characters to meet, &quot;Murders on the Yangtze River&quot; will have you hooked from the very beginning. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Stories</h2>Embark on a thrilling journey full of extraordinary cases and plot twists! Players take on the role John Shen, a traveling detective who seeks truth and revenge for his brother\u2019s death. Along his journey, he encounters numerous cases that are full of mystery, drama and suspense. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/a2b91792b8216cbb7857868b5cc862ef.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memorable Characters</h2>The game has many unforgettable characters. John Shen, for instance, is a refined gentleman with a sharp intellect. But as you delve deeper, you discover that he harbors a darker side to his personality. His vivacious assistant, Frankie, is a beacon of positivity who is always eager to use his technological inventions in their investigations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rigorous Logical Reasoning</h2>Investigate crime scenes, search for evidence, debate with suspects, and identify the murderer using collected clues. Find contradictions within testimonies and unravel the mystery. There are also many challenging puzzles. Get ready for a gripping adventure!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy Access</h2>The game features an intuitive tutorial that starts off with straightforward controls and simple cases, gradually building up to more challenging scenarios. Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the game, it's designed to be easy to pick up and play at any skill level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pleasant Journey on\u00a0a\u00a0Chinese-style\u00a0Ink Wash Picture Scroll</h2>Journey through a beautiful ink wash landscape painting of China's mountains and rivers from a hundred years ago. Explore picturesque Dongting Lake, Yangzhou and Shanghai. Immerse yourself in local customs in this extraordinary picture scroll.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>[Main Story]</strong><br>John Shen, the protagonist of this story, studied law in London alongside his brother, who was studying biology. One day, Shen's brother was found dead in his dormitory, and the police ruled his death as suicide. But when Shen stumbled upon a newly published detective novel on Shanghai News that depicted a murder scene identical to his brother's death, he began to suspect foul play. Convinced that the amateur writer was somehow involved in his brother's death, Shen returned to China to uncover the truth.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unexpected Misfortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/5b2633e35bf1784ed380a333183c5f909605f663.jpg"},{"name":"Lady in the Wardrobe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/24a57f7094af40af8e30c9ef9d09d719bfb02ec9.jpg"},{"name":"The Haunted Furnace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/96a6fa144c7a6f39bce47915f355a59e2748db13.jpg"},{"name":"Mystic Ship in the Mist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/409bd500d030db7c49f471c6f21817c6f8b2f8aa.jpg"},{"name":"The Confined Room Mystery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/98aaf2135aca916771b6eef1302c3e25b90c90f8.jpg"},{"name":"The Shanghai Enigma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/bbae9669bb75e92daea546665e74ed36feb72ff8.jpg"},{"name":"FFATS RUO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/98c88f1214516e88ef1b731494ce3031be511f84.jpg"},{"name":"Learned Sage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/fd4666fb4245301457b91ebc65e1f1a32aac2294.jpg"},{"name":"Traveling Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/d42d11110175f717e16051359764edc88615e63f.jpg"},{"name":"Destined Endings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1746030/99f3a4469a858bd8a6b9017b9a1fc3a374f5771b.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1746030?t=1770695571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770695571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770695571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770695571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2068780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>English version is coming on March 15th!</h1><p>Hello, detectives!<br><br>Thanks to our team\u2019s tireless efforts, the English version of \u201cMurders on the Yangtze River\u201d will launch this Friday, March 15th!<br><br>The game\u2019s story takes place in 1900s China, but its thrilling plot and heartfelt emotions will resonate with players from a wide range of cultural backgrounds.<br><br>We hope players across the globe will enjoy the gameplay, the story, and the opportunity to learn more about this critical era in China\u2019s history!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>If you're a fan of &quot;Ace Attorney&quot;, you won't want to miss &quot;Murders on Yangtze River&quot;, a horizontal axis detective game developed by OMEGames Studio. <br><br>The game takes you on a journey through early 20th century China as you solve a series of intriguing cases along the Yangtze River. With its stunning brush painting art style and engaging storyline, it offers a unique gaming experience that will keep you on the edge of your seat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/b7158f9d4b1a1eb75314725334ac764d.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your logical reasoning and deduction skills to uncover clues, interrogate suspects, and solve the mysteries. With challenging puzzles and interesting characters to meet, &quot;Murders on the Yangtze River&quot; will have you hooked from the very beginning. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/1672136dbcfdfb6137f69c12c45dee6b.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging Stories</h2>Embark on a thrilling journey full of extraordinary cases and plot twists! Players take on the role John Shen, a traveling detective who seeks truth and revenge for his brother\u2019s death. Along his journey, he encounters numerous cases that are full of mystery, drama and suspense. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/a2b91792b8216cbb7857868b5cc862ef.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memorable Characters</h2>The game has many unforgettable characters. John Shen, for instance, is a refined gentleman with a sharp intellect. But as you delve deeper, you discover that he harbors a darker side to his personality. His vivacious assistant, Frankie, is a beacon of positivity who is always eager to use his technological inventions in their investigations. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/950005d4e14e58f5047b0cd0a0d759f1.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rigorous Logical Reasoning</h2>Investigate crime scenes, search for evidence, debate with suspects, and identify the murderer using collected clues. Find contradictions within testimonies and unravel the mystery. There are also many challenging puzzles. Get ready for a gripping adventure!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/e21bc8d274e354d6ec6109d39b0675d9.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy Access</h2>The game features an intuitive tutorial that starts off with straightforward controls and simple cases, gradually building up to more challenging scenarios. Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the game, it's designed to be easy to pick up and play at any skill level.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/2fc306149d00b4edeee64e9c0a64852c.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pleasant Journey on\u00a0a\u00a0Chinese-style\u00a0Ink Wash Picture Scroll</h2>Journey through a beautiful ink wash landscape painting of China's mountains and rivers from a hundred years ago. Explore picturesque Dongting Lake, Yangzhou and Shanghai. Immerse yourself in local customs in this extraordinary picture scroll.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.poster.avif?t=1770695571\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.webm?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/extras/208e212a3734d172eef831c7f3f91e76.mp4?t=1770695571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>[Main Story]</strong><br>John Shen, the protagonist of this story, studied law in London alongside his brother, who was studying biology. One day, Shen's brother was found dead in his dormitory, and the police ruled his death as suicide. But when Shen stumbled upon a newly published detective novel on Shanghai News that depicted a murder scene identical to his brother's death, he began to suspect foul play. Convinced that the amateur writer was somehow involved in his brother's death, Shen returned to China to uncover the truth.","developers":["OMEGAMES STUDIO"],"dlc":[2808420],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1746030/header.jpg?t=1770695571","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1746030/716218/b92216f5e9b8acd13bc012a081f0dadd95e6f2db/1750731861/dash_av1.mpd?t=1718859906","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1746030/716218/b92216f5e9b8acd13bc012a081f0dadd95e6f2db/1750731861/dash_h264.mpd?t=1718859906","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1746030